window.bookSummaryJSON = "<p>The year is 1625...</p> <p>It is a time of great sickness as the black plague holds all in its grip.</p> <p>A hardy band of vampyres: the kindred, Nosferatu, Soul-Eaters... a living human vampyre born from blood, and a trio created from experiments by an ancient one... One who seeks to control all.</p> <p>This is the story of Emeline Gardner and those that contributed to her path.</p> <p>it is a dark path with many directions that they could go.</p> <p>But the time will come for her to awaken and become... during a war between the breeds.</p> <p>The journey will take you from London, England to the catacombs beneath St. Bride's Church to Truro, Cornwall and back again.</p> <p>The blood, and breath is the life.</p>"; 
